# InitMicroservice

Any microservice always uses these ports. Do not pick other numbers.

```csharp
const int GrpcPort = 28700;
const int InternalPort = 8080;

builder.InitMicroservice<AppDbContext>(options =>
{
    options.Config = config;
    options.AddGrpc = true;
    options.GrpcPort = GrpcPort;
    options.InternalPort = InternalPort;
    options.ConfigureServices = services =>
    {
        services.AddScoped<AppServiceBase, AppGrpcService>();
        services.AddApplication();
    };
});

app.UseMicroservice<AppDbContext, AppGrpcService>(GrpcPort, InternalPort);
```
